  "publishedAt": "2026-05-01T11:08:32.000Z",
  "content": "<div id=\"readability-page-1\" class=\"page\"><div> <div data-username=\"aaronp613\" id=\"m\"> <div> <p><a href=\"https://xcancel.com/aaronp613\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1837168376386371584/AJZZayD4_bigger.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></p> </div> <p>Apple accidentally left Claude.md files in today's Apple Support app update (v5.13)</p> <div> <p><a href=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HHMDhzqXEAATAX9.jpg?name=orig\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HHMDhzqXEAATAX9.jpg?name=small&amp;format=webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></p> <p><a href=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HHMDjqRW8AASLPK.jpg?name=orig\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HHMDjqRW8AASLPK.jpg?name=small&amp;format=webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></p> </div> <p>Apr 30, 2026 · 10:57 PM UTC</p> <p><span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 196</p></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 662</p></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 10,299</p></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 1,365,224</p></span> </p> </div> <div data-username=\"aaronp613\"> <div> <p><a href=\"https://xcancel.com/aaronp613\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1837168376386371584/AJZZayD4_bigger.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></p> </div> <div> <p>I guess Apple saw my tweet. Apple has released an emergency update to the Apple Support app (v5.13.1) to remove the Claude.md files</p> </div> <p><span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 1</p></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 2</p></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 129</p></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 49,767</p></span> </p> </div> </div><div id=\"r\"> <div data-username=\"cybearcloud\"> <div> <p><a href=\"https://xcancel.com/cybearcloud\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1696889443985010688/N53uTulC_bigger.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></p> </div> <p>It's a problem of these company firing devs. Who knows an agent push the code automatically. Who was the reviewer? Another agent problem. How soon can we realise that AI is not the end game. The humans in the loop are.</p> <p><span></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 2</p></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 2</p></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 3,720</p></span> </p> </div> <div data-username=\"Drosehn\"> <div> <p><a href=\"https://xcancel.com/Drosehn\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/210812219/Myspace-Image_bigger.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></p> </div> <p>Multiple replies say that this proves Apple was using Claude all the time they said they were working on a better Siri.  While it *might* be true that Apple has been using Claude all that time, all *this* proves is that Apple is using Claude right now.  ...</p> <p><span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 1</p></span> <span></span> <span></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 2,873</p></span> </p> </div> <div data-username=\"agusbuilds\"> <div> <p><a href=\"https://xcancel.com/agusbuilds\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2040025003458985984/wFTKY2yA_bigger.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></p> </div> <p>Apple's CLAUDE.md: 10 lines.\nThat \"ultimate AI setup\" thread you bookmarked: 200 rules, 3 frameworks, and a morning routine.</p> <p><span></span> <span></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 2</p></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 664</p></span> </p> </div> <div data-username=\"c_mykins\"> <div> <p><a href=\"https://xcancel.com/c_mykins\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1912523405015846913/A185VSRH_bigger.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></p> </div> <p>What terminal is that (or if not, what program)? Looks clean</p> <p><span></span> <span></span> <span></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 124</p></span> </p> </div> <div data-username=\"surti_sneh65996\"> <div> <p><a href=\"https://xcancel.com/surti_sneh65996\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2020875923244089346/4ss7H_1p_bigger.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></p> </div> <p>We used to worry about shipping API keys.\n\nNow we also have to worry about shipping the markdown file that tells the AI how the company thinks.</p> <p><span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 1</p></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 3</p></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 462</p></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 50,093</p></span> </p> </div> <div data-username=\"Arcturus_f\"> <div> <p><a href=\"https://xcancel.com/Arcturus_f\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1494243714419421189/RLlEpWr0_bigger.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></p> </div> <p>this explains why apple software is enshittifying</p> <p><span></span> <span></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 142</p></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 9,021</p></span> </p> </div> <div data-username=\"ziwenxu_\"> <div> <p><a href=\"https://xcancel.com/ziwenxu_\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2009704432674426880/Q29hAGJR_bigger.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></p> </div> <p>I have a friend in apple.\n\nHe has over 200 dollars credit on claude everyday to spend.\n\nso yea.. claude is everywhere</p> <p><span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 12</p></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 10</p></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 812</p></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 73,505</p></span> </p> </div> <div data-username=\"techedgedaily\"> <div> <p><a href=\"https://xcancel.com/techedgedaily\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1990787444112044041/NytyqO_N_bigger.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></p> </div> <p>Apple is using Claude Code to build their apps and just accidentally proved it.\nClaude.md files were left in the latest Apple Support app update. The same configuration files developers use to instruct Claude Code on how to work with their codebase shipped to millions of iPhones today.\nThe most secretive tech company in the world just leaked their AI development workflow through a forgotten file in a routine app update.\nSomewhere in Cupertino an engineer is having the worst day of their career. Somewhere at Anthropic the sales team is having the best one.</p> <p><span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 1</p></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 6</p></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 69</p></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 20,309</p></span> </p> </div> <div data-username=\"sohil_shah20\"> <div> <p><a href=\"https://xcancel.com/sohil_shah20\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1991278115834982401/iGFCVAC5_bigger.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></p> </div> <p>apple's been running mythos preview on their own stack via glasswing for weeks. genuinely curious what the report card looked like! ios/macos has been the cleanest in the game vs windows/android forever. ironic that we're finding out about their claude usage via a shipped .md file 💀</p> <p><span></span> <span></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 3</p></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 3,622</p></span> </p> </div> <div data-username=\"marcelo_earth\"> <div> <p><a href=\"https://xcancel.com/marcelo_earth\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1975036267738841088/hCbsj0cE_bigger.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></p> </div> <p>lmao and I think this isn’t the first time we know Apple uses Claude Code</p> <p><span></span> <span></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 166</p></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 21,124</p></span> </p> </div> <div data-username=\"RandomBriefs\"> <div> <p><a href=\"https://xcancel.com/RandomBriefs\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2036456854482530304/yFSx1fv__bigger.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></p> </div> <p>Someone is going to get fired for this.\n\nEspecially after they banned the vibe-coded apps from the App Store.\n\nIt seems like the message is You may not make vibe-coded apps, but Apple can support you with vibe-coded updates.</p> <p><span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 3</p></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 1</p></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 28</p></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 6,646</p></span> </p> </div> <div data-username=\"TomAIdaily\"> <div> <p><a href=\"https://xcancel.com/TomAIdaily\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2038522261456695296/qwxLjC7Y_bigger.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></p> </div> <p>so the support app update was actually a debug dump?\nwould love to know if they caught that before rollout</p> <p><span></span> <span></span> <span></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 3,798</p></span> </p> </div> <div data-username=\"dedbeddedbed\"> <div> <p><a href=\"https://xcancel.com/dedbeddedbed\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1799304604003315712/U0AqjaiP_bigger.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></p> </div> <p>No way 😭😭</p> <div><p><a href=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HHMRrcsW0AA6E75.jpg?name=orig\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HHMRrcsW0AA6E75.jpg?name=small&amp;format=webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></p></div> <p><span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 5</p></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 11</p></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 268</p></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 41,711</p></span> </p> </div> <div data-username=\"_rockgu\"> <div> <p><a href=\"https://xcancel.com/_rockgu\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1451355146517102592/nZK1QAHO_bigger.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></p> </div> <p>the irony is thick here\n\nthe ai tooling space can't stop accidentally publishing what it's trying to hide</p> <div> <p>this is the second claude-adjacent leak in 30 days\n\nmarch: CI/CD misconfig → 512k lines exposed. devs found anthropic had been reading opencode's source while sending it legal threats\n\napril: apple support app ships claude.md to 100k users\n\nai labs love controlling narratives. they're bad at it</p> </div> <p><span></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 2</p></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 18</p></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 21,441</p></span> </p> </div> <div data-username=\"dootskyre\"> <div> <p><a href=\"https://xcancel.com/dootskyre\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2049651798215176192/BrokTJew_bigger.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></p> </div> <p>given tap to radar and juno being mentioned oooooh they are not good at hiding shit lmao</p> <p><span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 1</p></span> <span></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 23</p></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 10,775</p></span> </p> </div> <div data-username=\"cybearcloud\"> <div> <p><a href=\"https://xcancel.com/cybearcloud\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1696889443985010688/N53uTulC_bigger.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></p> </div> <p>The code writer and reviewer just unlocked the 'Big Trouble' achievement.</p> <p><span></span> <span></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 2</p></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 912</p></span> </p> </div> <div data-username=\"clinicalindian\"> <div> <p><a href=\"https://xcancel.com/clinicalindian\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1825218848678653952/9X4kDqJx_bigger.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></p> </div> <p>What does this claude md file defines . Can someone explain in laymans term 😄</p> <p><span></span> <span></span> <span></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 1,095</p></span> </p> </div> <div data-username=\"heff1667\"> <div> <p><a href=\"https://xcancel.com/heff1667\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2008342978624909312/lAygZ6OK_bigger.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></p> </div> <p>lmao, people are going to copy this into their repos with expectations that they build the next trillion dollar company. We're definitely regressing in intelligence.</p> <p><span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 3</p></span> <span></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 115</p></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 16,991</p></span> </p> </div> <div data-username=\"bat213sdf\"> <div> <p><a href=\"https://xcancel.com/bat213sdf\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1751217197207216128/d9PVVM1d_bigger.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></p> </div> <p>this is why apple software gets worse and worse every day</p> <p><span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 1</p></span> <span></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 1</p></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 3,618</p></span> </p> </div> <div data-username=\"dylan2045ad\"> <div> <p><a href=\"https://xcancel.com/dylan2045ad\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2016953487741890561/aYXTvOsO_bigger.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></p> </div> <p>that would be a dream if June.8 was a Mythos distillation instead of Gemini</p> <p><span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 1</p></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 1</p></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 30</p></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 26,876</p></span> </p> </div> <div data-username=\"jcxdev\"> <div> <p><a href=\"https://xcancel.com/jcxdev\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1436696508133515270/B81eaisE_bigger.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></p> </div> <p><span></span> <span></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 2</p></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 1,545</p></span> </p> </div> <div data-username=\"whatmarcusdoes1\"> <div> <p><a href=\"https://xcancel.com/whatmarcusdoes1\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2038965420548370432/IzJ-9JXF_bigger.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></p> </div> <p>wait, did they just hand out the cheat codes for free?\ni need to know if those files actually work or if it's just a glitch.</p> <p><span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 3</p></span> <span></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 1</p></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 12,112</p></span> </p> </div> <div data-username=\"therutkat\"> <div> <p><a href=\"https://xcancel.com/therutkat\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1912932584935301120/yMvXojuk_bigger.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></p> </div> <p>That's the first file all claude code users need to know. Run /init</p> <p><span></span> <span></span> <span></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 1,091</p></span> </p> </div> <div data-username=\"o_stefanishyna\"> <div> <p><a href=\"https://xcancel.com/o_stefanishyna\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1745683231347736576/H_vt1rey_bigger.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></p> </div> <p>And their bots in social media scream \"No vibe coded apps in Apple Store!\"</p> <p><span></span> <span></span> <span></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 233</p></span> </p> </div> <div data-username=\"FlyboardIntern\"> <div> <p><a href=\"https://xcancel.com/FlyboardIntern\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2033910489206689793/jlV5hKgF_bigger.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></p> </div> <p>Apple accidentally shipping Claude.md is how you know vibe coding has reached market saturation</p> <p><span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 3</p></span> <span></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 80</p></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 15,445</p></span> </p> </div> <div data-username=\"83f3d8208f10\"> <div> <p><a href=\"https://xcancel.com/83f3d8208f10\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1458449136874061827/A_4JoyNJ_bigger.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></p> </div> <p>That's why their app become much disgusted for end users.</p> <p><span></span> <span></span> <span></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 3,954</p></span> </p> </div> <div data-username=\"djtaoao\"> <div> <p><a href=\"https://xcancel.com/djtaoao\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1971524775702142976/EoM91Soq_bigger.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></p> </div> <p>Can you release the full file.i don't have apple decive but i want to see how apple build their app</p> <p><span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 1</p></span> <span></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 2</p></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 6,331</p></span> </p> </div> <div data-username=\"tombielecki\"> <div> <p><a href=\"https://xcancel.com/tombielecki\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/753767705967079425/oZnW7oYF_bigger.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></p> </div> <p>And honestly? That's rare.</p> <p><span></span> <span></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 30</p></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 7,692</p></span> </p> </div> <div data-username=\"aaalisson\"> <div> <p><a href=\"https://xcancel.com/aaalisson\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1905176719226703872/_mwYcgwG_bigger.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></p> </div> <p>Explain to a normie like me</p> <p><span></span> <span></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 1</p></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 1,178</p></span> </p> </div> <div data-username=\"Calamash\"> <div> <p><a href=\"https://xcancel.com/Calamash\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1972461739334598656/_Iph5bWJ_bigger.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></p> </div> <p><a href=\"https://xcancel.com/Tak291\" title=\"Kike\">@Tak291</a> not sure if vibes coding is making people more sloppy, or if AI is making it easier to find vulnerabilities?</p> <p><span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 1</p></span> <span></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 1</p></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 6,035</p></span> </p> </div> <div data-username=\"ZohaDtox\"> <div> <p><a href=\"https://xcancel.com/ZohaDtox\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2039390316449648640/Ozac8Nic_bigger.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></p> </div> <p>So,,,, what’s wrong about it:) Ai is just a tool</p> <p><span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 2</p></span> <span></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 4</p></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 5,126</p></span> </p> </div> <div data-username=\"Jacoob_shi\"> <div> <p><a href=\"https://xcancel.com/Jacoob_shi\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2035190719540023296/K9Xwnynk_bigger.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></p> </div> <p>imagine being the engineer who shipped that lmao. claude.md just chilling in the apple support app</p> <p><span></span> <span></span> <span></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 9,254</p></span> </p> </div> <div data-username=\"AliceReveHaut\"> <div> <p><a href=\"https://xcancel.com/AliceReveHaut\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2042257181077368832/0s70wFGV_bigger.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></p> </div> <p>Interesting to see this. Shows how fast these tools are moving into real products. Wondering how much actually makes it to production.</p> <p><span></span> <span></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 1</p></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 7,981</p></span> </p> </div> <div data-username=\"creatorsidd\"> <div> <p><a href=\"https://xcancel.com/creatorsidd\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2026157175496957952/j9omATPw_bigger.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></p> </div> <p>I wish there more leaks about the upcoming products but yeah, Claude is everywhere. And leaking things everywhere</p> <p><span></span> <span></span> <span></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 5,810</p></span> </p> </div> <div data-username=\"lui_nilo\"> <div> <p><a href=\"https://xcancel.com/lui_nilo\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1936137594145841152/yTUjuL7M_bigger.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></p> </div> <p>Developer didn't read shit\n \"Pushed to github\" and left it at that 😂😂</p> <p><span></span> <span></span> <span></span> <span><p><span title=\"\"></span> 3,855</p></span> </p> </div> </div></div>",
